<section class="section-pad bg-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Our Company</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">We've been building North Shore homes since 2001.</h2>
        <p class="section-body-wide" style="margin-bottom:20px;">WORKS by JD was founded in Beverly, Massachusetts by Jesse DeBenedictis with a straightforward mission: deliver the quality of a custom home builder to homeowners doing large-scale renovation work. No subcontracting everything out. No disappearing project managers. One integrated team that owns the design and the build.</p>
        <p class="section-body-wide" style="margin-bottom:20px;">Over 24 years, we've completed hundreds of projects across the North Shore — from Beverly and Manchester-by-the-Sea to Gloucester, Rockport, Ipswich, and beyond. We've earned four NARI certifications, our Massachusetts CS and HIC licenses, and a reputation that lets most of our work come from referrals.</p>
        <p class="section-body-wide" style="margin-bottom:32px;">We're not the largest remodeler in the region. We're the most thorough. Every project gets Jesse's personal attention — the standards haven't changed since day one.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="/about/our-story" class="btn btn-primary">Read Our Story</a>
          <a href="/about/meet-the-team" class="btn btn-outline">Meet the Team</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="background:var(--forge-900);border-radius:var(--r-2xl);padding:48px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card-hover);">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--forge-500);margin-bottom:28px;">Credentials &amp; Licenses</div>
          <div style="display:grid;gap:20px;">
            <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--forge-700);padding-bottom:20px;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--forge-500);margin-bottom:6px;">MA Construction Supervisor</div><div style="font-family:monospace;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:white;">CS-91245</div></div>
            <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--forge-700);padding-bottom:20px;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--forge-500);margin-bottom:6px;">MA Home Improvement Contractor</div><div style="font-family:monospace;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:white;">HIC-178604</div></div>
            <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--forge-700);padding-bottom:20px;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--forge-500);margin-bottom:6px;">NARI Certifications</div><div style="color:white;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">CRPM — Certified Remodeler Project Manager<br/>CR — Certified Remodeler<br/>CKBR — Certified Kitchen &amp; Bath Remodeler<br/>CLC — Certified Lead Carpenter</div></div>
            <div><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--forge-500);margin-bottom:6px;">Industry Memberships</div><div style="color:white;font-size:14px;">NARI National · NARI New England Chapter</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
