  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad" style="background:white;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-center"><div class="section-eyebrow">What Makes Us Different</div><h2 class="section-title">The WORKS by JD standards.</h2></div>
    <div class="grid-3" style="gap:24px;">
      <div class="why-card"><div class="why-card-icon">🏗️</div><h3 class="why-card-title">True Design-Build</h3><p class="why-card-body">Design and construction under one roof, one contract, one accountable team. No finger-pointing between your architect and your GC — we're both.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><div class="why-card-icon">🛡️</div><h3 class="why-card-title">7-Year Warranty</h3><p class="why-card-body">The most comprehensive workmanship warranty in the industry. Seven full years covering all WORKS labor on every project — unconditionally.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><div class="why-card-icon">📱</div><h3 class="why-card-title">Client Portal</h3><p class="why-card-body">Every client gets online access to their project schedule, daily photo updates, material sign-off requests, and direct messaging with their team.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><div class="why-card-icon">🎓</div><h3 class="why-card-title">NARI Certified</h3><p class="why-card-body">Four NARI industry certifications including CRPM, CR, CKBR, and CLC — the remodeling industry's most respected credential system.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><div class="why-card-icon">📍</div><h3 class="why-card-title">North Shore Roots</h3><p class="why-card-body">Based in Beverly since 2001. We know these homes, these towns, these building departments, and these subcontractors. Local knowledge matters.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><div class="why-card-icon">🤝</div><h3 class="why-card-title">Zero-Stress Process</h3><p class="why-card-body">We manage permits, inspections, supplier relationships, and job site coordination. You make decisions; we handle everything else.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-center"><div class="section-eyebrow">Our Leadership</div><h2 class="section-title">The people behind every project.</h2></div>
