      <div class="team-card" style="max-width:380px;">
        <div class="team-card-avatar">JD</div>
        <div class="team-card-name">Jesse DeBenedictis</div>
        <div class="team-card-title">Founder &amp; Principal</div>
        <div class="team-card-certs">CRPM · CR · CKBR · CLC</div>
        <p class="team-card-bio">Jesse founded WORKS by JD in 2001 after a decade of field experience in residential construction. He holds four NARI certifications and remains personally involved in every project — from the initial consultation through the final walkthrough. His philosophy: do it right, back it up, and never compromise on quality.</p>
        <a href="/about/our-story" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" style="margin-top:8px;">Read Jesse's Story</a>
